### 住宿第三阶段联调
### 前置：执行第一、第二阶段请求，创建并支付住宿订单；后台已维护实体房间

### 用户登录
# @name userLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "住宿用户",
  "accountType": "USER"
}

### 用户生成一次性入住码
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/hotel/bookings/1/check-in-code
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 管理员登录
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "酒店前台",
  "accountType": "ADMIN"
}

### 前台按订单状态、订单号、联系人姓名或手机号查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/bookings?status=PAID&keyword=13800138000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 使用入住码核销并分配实体房间
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/check-in/by-code
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-checkin-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checkInCode": "HC-HR20260804180000ABCDEF-123456789ABC",
  "roomIds": [1],
  "allowEarlyCheckIn": false,
  "note": "前台扫码办理入住"
}

### 使用证件号码核验入住
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/check-in/by-id-card
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-id-checkin-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idNo": "110101199001011234",
  "roomIds": [1],
  "allowEarlyCheckIn": false,
  "note": "证件核验入住"
}

### 同房型换房
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/bookings/1/change-room
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-change-room-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromRoomId": 1,
  "toRoomId": 2,
  "reason": "客人申请安静房间"
}

### 续住
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/bookings/1/extend
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-extend-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newCheckOutDate": "2026-10-06",
  "remark": "续住一晚，退房时补收"
}

### 退房试算
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/bookings/1/checkout-quote
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"chargeType": "MINIBAR", "description": "迷你吧饮品", "quantity": 2, "unitPriceCent": 1000},
  {"chargeType": "LATE_CHECKOUT", "description": "延迟退房", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceCent": 5000}
]

### 确认退房结算，金额必须与试算结果一致
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/bookings/1/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: hotel-checkout-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "charges": [
    {"chargeType": "MINIBAR", "description": "迷你吧饮品", "quantity": 2, "unitPriceCent": 1000},
    {"chargeType": "LATE_CHECKOUT", "description": "延迟退房", "quantity": 1, "unitPriceCent": 5000}
  ],
  "additionalPaidCent": 45800,
  "refundCent": 0,
  "paymentMethod": "WECHAT",
  "remark": "正常退房"
}

### 房间清洁完成
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/rooms/2/clean-complete
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 到店和逾期预警
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/warnings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### 住宿经营报表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/hotels/operations/report?startDate=2026-10-01&endDate=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
